# Arc 3 · Mission 4 — Convergence. The finale: lineages 3 and 4, both hostile to each other and
# to the player, on a triangle board. Lineage 4 was bred against 3; neither was bred to face the
# other while a third seat is in play.

[level]
arc       = 3
index     = 4
id        = 17
title     = Convergence
blurb     = Two lineages, one board, no allies. The population has been converging; now it is in the same room.
objective = Be the last faction standing.
hint      = They were bred against each other one-on-one. A third party at the table is a case neither has met.
hint      = Whichever of them is ahead attracts the other. Stay behind both until it is decided.
hint      = The middle posts are worth less than they look: whoever takes them is seen by both.
enemy     = evolved 3
enemy     = evolved 4
horizon   = 6000

